! 15-APR-2014, Y. Nosochkov
!  * update collimator jaw aperture per LCLSII-2.4-PR-0095
! 09-APR-2014, Y. Nosochkov
!  * add SXR betatron collimators CXBP30, CXBP34
! 07-APR-2014, M. Woodley
